{
  "id": "poem-011",
  "body": "<div class=\"poem-text\"><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-1\"><span class=\"poem-line\">我们一直在告别，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">无时无刻都在与人事物告别。</span></p><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-2\"><span class=\"poem-line\">虽知别离苦，但仍然要学会去享受，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">不怕它发生，也不怕它结束，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">我们勇于让它发生，也坦然让它结束。</span></p><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-3\"><span class=\"poem-line\">我要告诉你光是从哪里来的。</span></p></div><figure class=\"poem-illustration\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"poem-art-open\" data-poem-art=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/011.webp\" data-caption=\"《师》\" aria-label=\"放大欣赏插画《师》\"><img src=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/011.webp\" width=\"885\" height=\"1050\" alt=\"亮子绘制的原书插画《师》\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></button><figcaption>《师》 · 亮子<span>轻触画面，放大欣赏</span></figcaption></figure><p class=\"poem-original-page\">原书第 11 页</p>"
}
